cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Reflex in your work, please cite it with the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Reflex: a pre-execution risk gate and prompt injection guard for AI coding agents"
abstract: >-
  Reflex is an open-source pre-execution risk gate and prompt injection guard for AI coding
  agents such as Claude Code, Codex CLI, opencode, pi, oh-my-pi and Hermes. Through each agent's
  hooks it decides for every shell command whether it runs, needs a human's approval, or is
  blocked, and it scans tool results for prompt injection. Local deterministic rules come first;
  uncovered commands go to a local engine, to TypeSafe Jev (a hosted System One model) through an
  editable policy file, or to an experimental local Laya engine. An autonomous profile adds a
  stronger model (System 2) and an asynchronous human approval queue.
authors:
